和史蒂夫·卡瑞尔一起的时候。

886
00:41:33.070 --> 00:41:33.490
I don't.
我不记得了。

887
00:41:33.650 --> 00:41:36.210
My memory of it is they didn't do it very many times.
我的记忆是他们没拍多少次。

888
00:41:36.410 --> 00:41:36.630
Okay.
好吧。

889
00:41:37.790 --> 00:41:39.430
Well, now we're into the episode.
好了，现在进入正题。

890
00:41:39.730 --> 00:41:40.590
It's Ethics Day.
今天是道德日。

891
00:41:40.950 --> 00:41:43.530
Holly has passed out a form everyone has to fill out.
霍莉发了一份表格，要求每个人都必须填写。

892
00:41:43.730 --> 00:41:45.430
She's going to be taking this seriously.
她打算认真对待这件事。

893
00:41:45.690 --> 00:41:46.250
She is.
确实如此。

894
00:41:46.390 --> 00:41:49.830
She explains that she is going to be running her first meeting.
她解释说她要主持她的第一次会议。

895
00:41:50.430 --> 00:41:51.650
But don't worry.
但别担心。

896
00:41:51.670 --> 00:41:54.230
We talked about this with Amy Ryan.
我们和艾米·瑞恩聊过这个。

897
00:41:55.050 --> 00:42:00.290
Michael's going to help her out, and they're going to start it off with their version of
迈克尔会帮她，他们会以他们版本的

898
00:42:00.290 --> 00:42:01.530
let's get physical.
“让我们动起来”作为开场。

899
00:42:02.110 --> 00:42:06.130
With headbands and dancing and a boombox.
戴着头带，跳着舞，还带着一台手提音响。

900
00:42:06.490 --> 00:42:08.350
Jenna, I worked in corporate America.
珍娜，我在美国企业界工作过。

901
00:42:08.430 --> 00:42:13.750
I have been in human resources seminars that we had to go to.
我参加过必须出席的人力资源研讨会。

902
00:42:13.930 --> 00:42:14.090
Yeah.
是啊。

903
00:42:14.090 --> 00:42:16.350
I'm telling you, they had skits.
我跟你说，他们还演小品呢。

904
00:42:16.690 --> 00:42:17.130
What?
什么？

905
00:42:17.550 --> 00:42:23.070
When I watched this, I had such a flood of memories coming back of sitting in a tiny little
看这一段的时候，我脑海里涌现出好多回忆，想起以前在那家公司工作时，

906
00:42:23.070 --> 00:42:25.430
